CONTEXT Kurk IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Kurk
{+ The existing system of the proof of concept in
"Data Migration under a Changing Schema in Ampersand" (RAMiCS 2024).
It has one relation, `r[A*B]`, and no constraint.
Atoms a2 and a3 occur in no pair of `r`. +}

RELATION r[A*B] [UNI]
REPRESENT B TYPE ALPHANUMERIC

POPULATION A CONTAINS [ "a1", "a2", "a3" ]
POPULATION B CONTAINS [ "b1", "b2", "b3" ]
POPULATION r[A*B] CONTAINS [ ("a1", "b1") ]

ENDCONTEXT
